# Docs & memory

After any notable change, update the relevant doc so future sessions stay smart:

- `docs/CHANGELOG_AI.md` — what changed and why (append an entry).
- `docs/DECISIONS.md` — record significant choices and rationale.
- `docs/RISKS.md` — add/clear risks, with severity and mitigation.
- `docs/ROADMAP.md` — keep the prioritized next-steps list current.
- `docs/AI_REPO_MAP.md` — update if structure, commands, or env vars change.

Keep entries short and factual. Prefer linking to existing docs over
duplicating content. When you defer a major upgrade, log it in
`docs/upgrade/MAJOR_UPGRADE_BACKLOG.md`.
